els, check results). Designed for screen sharing and str"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"eaming. Server-side masking means labels never leak through API responses either; the underlying acc"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"ount data is never overwritten.\n* **Anonymized Diagnostics Report**: The settings card has a **Gener"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ate diagnostics report** block: one click fetches an anonymized report (plugin/runtime versions, OS,"},{"id":"p16s7","text":" per-vendor health counters, aggregate HTTP status counts, last ≥400 errors with timings, non-secret"},{"id":"p16s8","text":" settings) and copies it to the clipboard. Tokens, emails, credential refs and proxy URLs are strict"},{"id":"p16s9","text":"ly excluded (verified by tests).\n* **Issue-Ready**: The same block links to the project issue tracke"},{"id":"p16s10","text":"r, so a bug report is: generate → paste → submit."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["evidence","evidence"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
